# <type>(<scope>): <short imperative description, <=72 chars>
# Example: feat(siege): cache per-frame interval and rank
#
# Types: feat | fix | perf | refactor | docs | test | chore | ci
# Scopes: core | ui | infra | siege | opening | sfx | readme | ...
# - English only, imperative mood ("add", not "added")
# - One logical change per commit
# - Body (optional) explains WHY, not what
